{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey to Doloc Town \u2014 a post-apocalyptic oasis brimming with abandoned ruins, quirky architecture, and folks of all kinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Visual.gif?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revitalize this empty land and get to know the townies. Thrive and discover your destiny as you delve deeper into this unknown territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/1222.png?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Farming.gif?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources to build your farm from the ground up! As a farmer, you'll tend crops, build, craft, cook, cast your line, and so much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct charming buildings, upgrade your homestead, and craft handy tools to turn your quiet patch of land into a thriving countryside haven!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/1223.png?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Explore.gif?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore this unknown territory, with intricate valley, treacherous wetlands, and abandoned ruins await. Scout the vast, untouched wilderness in search of secret relics, treasures, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the heart of the map lies Doloc Town, a post-apocalyptic sanctuary built from the remnants of trains and collapsed bridges. Connect with villagers and share a drink to uncover the hidden stories of this land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Above all, the key is to endure the wasteland and follow whatever your heart truly desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/1221.png?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Weather.gif?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive the harsh elements of this post-apocalyptic world, from scorching heatwaves to deadly acid rains and beyond! Protect your crops and adapt to unpredictable conditions to keep your farmland thriving. Will you endure nature\u2019s fury, or will it overwhelm you? The choice is yours.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Step On The Farm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2285550/b5ab50970d61fee681fc2074029ea5a2866ca30a.jpg"},{"name":"Ten-Thousandaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2285550/95ab5bfeca27f3ee9f01b6fd9dfe67dc8bf40700.jpg"},{"name":"Farmstead Mogul","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2285550/d22166b255edd57246c402a746cf7015a669dda9.jpg"},{"name":"Wealth Is The Way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2285550/57d5fdd8a9924a8b46e61fddd720900cf368ca0e.jpg"},{"name":"Culinary Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2285550/841c5edbbfb308dabd6b955782edd9063bcd0c4c.jpg"},{"name":"Master Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2285550/465e3956086a5f27d2b3f437b153b3f9f7cc4b0a.jpg"},{"name":"Overcooked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2285550/dc4c0a10df606ad4b895fc9a27c3c116259fa181.jpg"},{"name":"It\u2019s Getting There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2285550/7df49a82a9fa2afdc23864d3d8c618ccc3af6a32.jpg"},{"name":"Post-Apocalyptic Oasis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2285550/dfda23c6dff9428dd6650c6d64801c92b5a04bd4.jpg"},{"name":"Taste of Ruin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2285550/37cfe937a28d63b828d5d7bd368a6e286cfe3e92.jpg"}],"total":43},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2285550?t=1746694837","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746694837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/814c3f9b4b9a58f3ec675fe1424c1ec219cef84a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746694837","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/814c3f9b4b9a58f3ec675fe1424c1ec219cef84a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746694837","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3243760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Report Issues and Join Our Community!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/\u591a\u6d1b\u53efdiscord\u56fe600x125.png?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To report BUGs &amp; feedback, please email our support team at <strong><i><a href=\"mailto:qa@logoi.net\">qa@logoi.net</a></i></strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey to Doloc Town \u2014 a post-apocalyptic oasis brimming with abandoned ruins, quirky architecture, and folks of all kinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Visual.gif?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revitalize this empty land and get to know the townies. Thrive and discover your destiny as you delve deeper into this unknown territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/1222.png?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Farming.gif?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources to build your farm from the ground up! As a farmer, you'll tend crops, build, craft, cook, cast your line, and so much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct charming buildings, upgrade your homestead, and craft handy tools to turn your quiet patch of land into a thriving countryside haven!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/1223.png?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Explore.gif?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore this unknown territory, with intricate valley, treacherous wetlands, and abandoned ruins await. Scout the vast, untouched wilderness in search of secret relics, treasures, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the heart of the map lies Doloc Town, a post-apocalyptic sanctuary built from the remnants of trains and collapsed bridges. Connect with villagers and share a drink to uncover the hidden stories of this land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Above all, the key is to endure the wasteland and follow whatever your heart truly desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/1221.png?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Weather.gif?t=1746694837\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive the harsh elements of this post-apocalyptic world, from scorching heatwaves to deadly acid rains and beyond! Protect your crops and adapt to unpredictable conditions to keep your farmland thriving. Will you endure nature\u2019s fury, or will it overwhelm you? The choice is yours.</p>","developers":["RedSaw Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/4f696f4c17ac4903f9a77d951b82e58e9101e59a/header.jpg?t=1746694837","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133229,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133229/movie480.mp4?t=1746668559","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133229/movie_max.mp4?t=1746668559"},"name":"Doloc Town Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133229/3ef3597c0fbf8178723faf0f4d55d8bde9646206/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746668559","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133229/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746668559","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133229/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746668559"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257101570,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101570/movie480.mp4?t=1740416299","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101570/movie_max.mp4?t=1740416299"},"name":"Steam Next Fest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101570/8c3c5dde62e88dd945931fddd29b4ad00dbc36f3/movie_600x337.jpg?